(f)
the lessee shall commence mining operations within two years from the date of execution of mining lease deed and shall
thereafter conduct such operations in a proper, skilful and workman-like manner.
Explanation. - For the purposes of this clause, "mining operations" shall include the erection of machinery, laying of a
